<title>USA: Group cuts stake in Bay View Capital.</title>
<headline>Group cuts stake in Bay View Capital.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by investor Michael Price said Wednesday it cut its stake in Bay View Capital Corp to 340,500 common shares or 4.9 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 257,200 common shares sold between August 6 and September 10 at prices ranging from $35.5625 to $39.2500 per share.</p>
